# reading 3 of phaedo-opposites.md by claude-opus-5-5
atom	has_opp(x)	x has an opposite
atom	gen_from_opp(x)	x is generated out of its opposite
atom	two_proc(x)	x has two intermediate processes, from one opposite to the other and back again
atom	opp_life_death	death is the opposite of life
atom	opp_sleep_wake	sleep is the opposite of waking
atom	wake_from_sleep	out of sleeping waking is generated, and out of waking sleeping
atom	dead_from_living	the dead are generated from the living
atom	living_from_dead	the living are generated from the dead
atom	souls_below	our souls exist in the world below
domain	life death sleep waking
# "of necessity" in S4 and S17 is not written as a modal, since modal logic here takes no all or some.
