P4	S27	opp_sleep_wake ∧ wake_from_sleep
P5	S31	opp_life_death
P6	S36	dead_from_living
P7	S38	living_from_dead
A1	-	opp_life_death → has_opp(life) ∧ has_opp(death)
A2	-	(gen_from_opp(life) → living_from_dead) ∧ (gen_from_opp(death) → dead_from_living)
C1	S39	living_from_dead	from P1 P5 A1 A2
# The step from the living being generated from the dead to souls existing below is left unstated in the text.
